# Implementation Plan - Modernizing Settings Dropdowns

To meet the "Premium Design" requirement and modernize the selection lists, we will replace all native `<select>` elements in [settings.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.html) with custom `div`-based dropdowns, reusing the existing `.custom-dropdown` styles from [dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard-dark.css).

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Settings UI - settings.html

#### [MODIFY] [settings.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.html)
- Replace `<div class="input-group"> ... <select> ...` with:
  ```html
  <div class="input-group">
      <label>Language</label>
      <div class="custom-dropdown" id="dropdown-language" data-value="en">
          <div class="dropdown-selected">English (US) <svg...>Chevron</svg></div>
          <div class="dropdown-options">
              <div class="dropdown-option" data-val="en">English (US)</div>
              <div class="dropdown-option" data-val="fr">French (Français)</div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Hidden input to store value for easy JS access -->
      <input type="hidden" id="set-language" value="en">
  </div>
  ```
- Apply this pattern to: Language, Theme, Timezone, GWP, Consolidation.

### [Component Name] Settings Logic - settings.js

#### [MODIFY] [settings.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.js)
- **Refactor [loadSettings](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.js#3-42)**:
    - Initialize the custom dropdowns with stored values.
    - Set the `data-value` and text content of `.dropdown-selected`.
- **Add Dropdown Logic**:
    - Implement a `setupDropdowns()` function to handle click-to-open and select-option interactions.
    - Ensure selecting an option updates the hidden input and the display text.
- **Refactor Save Functions**:
    - Simple update: since we use hidden inputs with the *original IDs* (`set-language`, etc.), the existing [saveGeneralSettings](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.js#43-54) logic (`document.getElementById('set-language').value`) should theoretically work without changes! We just need to ensure the hidden input is updated on selection.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Visuals**: Check that dropdowns look like the "Facility Selector" (glassmorphism/dark theme).
- **Interaction**: Verify clicking opens the menu, clicking outside closes it.
- **Selection**: Verify selecting an option updates the UI text and the hidden input.
- **Persistence**: Verify "Save Preferences" correctly reads the value from the hidden input and saves to localStorage.
- **Reload**: Verify reloading the page restores the correct state in the custom dropdowns.
